  "fullText": {
    "simplified": "你昨天去哪儿了\n\n本：露西，你昨天去哪儿了？\n露西：我去图书馆看书了，你呢？\n本：我昨天去学校旁边的超市买东西了。\n露西：啊，我昨天晚上也去那个超市买东西了。",
    "traditional": "你昨天去哪兒了\n\n本：露西，你昨天去哪兒了？\n露西：我去圖書館看書了，你呢？\n本：我昨天去學校旁邊的超市買東西了。\n露西：啊，我昨天晚上也去那個超市買東西了。"
  },
  "sentences": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "simplified": "\n\n",
      "traditional": "\n\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Where Did You Go Yesterday"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "simplified": "本：露西，你昨天去哪儿了？",
      "traditional": "本：露西，你昨天去哪兒了？",
      "pinyin": "běn lù xī nǐ zuó tiān qù nǎ'r le",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Ben: Lucy, where did you go yesterday?"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "露西：我去图书馆看书了，你呢？",
      "traditional": "露西：我去圖書館看書了，你呢？",
      "pinyin": "lù xī wǒ qù tú shū guǎn kàn shū le nǐ ne",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Lucy: I went to the library to study. What about you?"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "本：我昨天去学校旁边的超市买东西了。",
      "traditional": "本：我昨天去學校旁邊的超市買東西了。",
      "pinyin": "běn wǒ zuó tiān qù xué xiào páng biān de chāo shì mǎi dōng xi le",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Ben: Yesterday, I went to the supermarket next to the school to buy some things."
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "simplified": "露西：啊，我昨天晚上也去那个超市买东西了。",
      "traditional": "露西：啊，我昨天晚上也去那個超市買東西了。",
      "pinyin": "lù xī a wǒ zuó tiān wǎn shang yě qù nà ge chāo shì mǎi dōng xi le",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "simplified": "",
      "traditional": "",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Lucy: Ah! I also went to buy some things at that supermarket yesterday evening."
    }
  ],
